          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Really? Really! is the third eroge visual novel in the Shuffle! series created by Navel for Microsoft Windows. It is a continuation of Kaede's path from the first Shuffle! visual novel, and has a linear plot.\n\nIn Really? Really!, Kaede has lost her memories and throughout the game the player must fix them. Using keywords acquired from viewing various events in Kaede's memories, the player must fix mistakes in Kaede's past memories.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Really? Really! es la tercera novela visual eroge de la serie Shuffle!, creada por Navel para Microsoft Windows. Continúa la ruta de Kaede de la primera novela visual de Shuffle! y tiene una trama lineal.\n\nEn Really? Really!, Kaede ha perdido sus recuerdos, y a lo largo del juego el jugador debe restaurarlos. Usando palabras clave obtenidas al ver distintos eventos de los recuerdos de Kaede, el jugador debe corregir los errores en los recuerdos pasados de Kaede.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
